\\ overrides-pure.kl — host primitives needed by the standard Shen OS Kernel
\\ that are not defined in any .kl file.  Each Shen port must provide these.
\\ In our C VM, character streams are not supported, so both return false.

(defun shen.char-stinput? (V528) false)

(defun shen.char-stoutput? (V529) false)
